A2 has_reactions gate inverted	crates/mm-app/src/post.rs	let reactions = if post.has_reactions {	let reactions = if !post.has_reactions {	api
A3 deleted short circuit boundary off by one	crates/mm-app/src/post.rs	if post.delete_at > 0 && !opts.retain_content {	if post.delete_at >= 0 && !opts.retain_content {	api
A4 system-emoji filter inverted	crates/mm-app/src/post.rs	.filter(|name| get_system_emoji_id(name).is_none())	.filter(|name| get_system_emoji_id(name).is_some())	api
A5 second files pass dropped	crates/mm-app/src/post.rs	self.get_embeds_and_images(&mut post)?;\n        self.prepare_post_files_for_client(&mut post, opts).await;	self.get_embeds_and_images(&mut post)?;	api
